1 NAME Johan Henrik Abrahamsson /Schaefer/
2 GIVN Johan Henrik Abrahamsson
2 SURN Schaefer
2 _MARNM Schaefer
2 NICK Johan
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1657
