1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Residence: 1699 in Gundbo Västergård, Örby, Älvsborgs län with wife Gunilla Andersdotter - Described as "poor priest"
2 CONT
2 CONT Residence: 1703  in Vrå Andersgården, Kinna, Älvsborgs län with wife Gunilla Andersdotter. Spent the remainder of his life there.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1732: Occupation: Chaplain. Sold part of his property in Vrå as a "homestead for a military medicus"  Received  39 rd 28 sk silver coins for the sale. Wife also reported to be very ill and bedridden.
