1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Journal Star (Peoria, IL) - Thursday, June 19, 1997
2 CONT
2 CONT MORTON -- Elmore N. "Moe" Sieks , 77, of 828 E. Jackson St. died at 12:10 p.m. Tuesday, June 17, 1997, at Apostolic Christian 
2 CONT
2 CONT Restmor. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was born Feb. 23, 1920, in Peoria to August H. and Bertha I. Ehn Sieks . 
2 CONT
2 CONT Surviving are one brother, Elwood L. of Peoria; and two sisters, Lillian D. Logue of Commerce, Texas, and Alice I. Hobaugh of Cape Coral, Fla. He was preceded in death by five brothers and one sister. 
2 CONT
2 CONT A Caterpillar Inc. employee for 34 years, he retired in 1980 as a computer analyst for the Morton Parts Distribution Center. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a World War II Army veteran. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a member of Community United Church of Christ. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Services will be at 10:30 a.m. Saturday at Knapp-Johnson Funeral Home. The Rev. Dr. Roger Mealiff will officiate. Visitation will be from 6 to 8 p.m. Friday at the funeral home. Inurnment of cremains will be in American Mausoleum 
2 CONC in Peoria. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Memorials may be made to the American Cancer Society, 711 W. Crestwood Drive, Peoria, Ill. 61614-7024. 
