1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Catharina Christina Bertels==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Född: 	16 mars 1624 
2 CONT * Klosterlausnitz, Sachsen-Altenburg, Thüringen 
2 CONT
2 CONT * Död: 	11 mars 1694 (69) 
2 CONT * Malingsbo, Söderbärke (W) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Född:	 	Tyskland 1)	 	 Ny Svensk Släktbok, 1906 sid. 493-504 här står hon som okänd, men i SBL häfte 147 finns namnet på henne,
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Bartels 1624 Mecklenburg
2 CONT
2 CONT ref: http://www.genealogi.net/a-o/sok-i-gfs-ovriga-samlingar/gfs-ovriga-samlingar-b/
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.klosterlausnitz-regional.de/Chronik/1132-1889.html
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT NAME: Från http://kristinsweedler.com/history/genealogy.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Christina Bertels, Born 3/15 (or 16)/1624 in Germany (Death record says she died at the age of 69 years, 11 months, 26 days). Died 3/11/1694 in Söderbärke. It is possible that she is the Catherina Berthels listed as bein
2 CONC g born on August 16th, 1624 in Klosterlausnitz, Sachsen-Altenburg, Thuringen. This would be correct down to the day assuming that at some point the month 3 had been mistranscribed as an "8" (an easy thing to imagine). If this were
2 CONC  the case, her father and grandfather would be named Peter, as was her oldest son. There is a Per Bertels in the records of Tyska kyrkan, S:ta Gertruds , the same church that the Robsahm family attended.. (Husband XI:116, Child X:
2 CONC 117)
2 CONT
2 CONT ref: http://gw.geneanet.org/helenastark?lang=en&p=catharina+christina&n=bertels&templ=mobile
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
2 CONT
2 CONT Info from the "Pfarramt Bad Klosterlausnitz"
2 CONT
2 CONT I found a baptism entry of Catharina Bärtel, baptised 16th August 1624 There are two other Bärtel baptisms in the register (from 1604 and 1608). They could be her or her father's brothers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Se images appended under media
2 CONT
2 CONT Klosterlausnitz Nachbargemeinden:
2 CONT
2 CONT Angrenzende Gemeinden sind Bobeck, die Stadt Hermsdorf, Schleifreisen, Tautenhain, Waldeck und '''Weißenborn''' im Saale-Holzland-Kreis sowie Kraftsdorf im Landkreis Greiz.
2 CONT
2 CONT ref: https://de.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bad_Klosterlausnitz
