1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Georg_de_Laval '''Patrik ''Georg'' Fabian de Laval'''] was a Swedish sports shooter and modern pentathlete who competed in the 1912 Summer Olympics. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''He was part''' of the Swedish team that won the silver medal in the 50 m team military pistol event. Individually he won a bronze medal in the first-contested modern pentathlon.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''De Laval was''' born of a Swedish noble family. In 1913 he married baroness Ebba Fleetwood, the eldest daughter of baron Carl Fleetwood, 10th baron of Jälunda, and his first wife countess Hedvig, née Lewenhaupt. His brothers Pa
2 CONC trik and Erik were also Olympic pentathletes.
2 CONT
2 CONT /////
2 CONT
2 CONT [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/De_Laval_nr_355#TAB_13 '''Patrik ''Georg'' Fabian De Laval'''], född 1883-04-16 i Stockholm. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Mogenhetsexamen i''' nya Elementar lärov. Sthlm, 1901. Volontär vid 1:a Svea artilleriregemente 1901. Sergeant vid 1:a Svea artilleriregemente. Kadett vid Karlberg 1902. Styckjunkare i regemente 1903. Utexamen 1903. Underlöjtna
2 CONC nt vid regemente 1903. Löjtnant därstädes 1907. Avgångsexamen från instruktörskursen vid Gymn. centralinst. 1909. GV:sO1M. Kapten 1916. RSO 1924. RVO 1925. Major vid reg:tet 1927 f.o.m. 1928. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Gift 1913-04-03''' i Jakobs kyrka i Stockholm Adolf Fredriks förs, med friherrinnan Ebba Fleetwood, född 1890-11-26 i Jönköping, dotter av häradshövdingen i Västra Värends domsaga av kron.s län friherre Carl Fredrik Miles Fleet
2 CONC wood, och grevinnan Hedvig Ida Amalia Lewenhaupt.
