2 CONT * '''Peter Willebrand''' (born 1597 in Rostock, died 3.7.1638 in Güstrow) was the second pastor at the parish church in Güstrow from 1624 until his death; Son of the Rostock professor of morality '''Nikolaus Willebrand''' and gran
2 CONC dson of pastor '''Peter Willebrand''' in Gorlosen. 
