1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "" On the 2nd of May (1702), which was a Saturday evening at 8 o'clock, died in
2 CONT the city of Gothenburg, the formerly honorable and skilled student young person and high school
2 CONT student Canutus Petri Cervinius, who had been ill from a violent fever since Wednesday the 22nd of
2 CONT April, on the 11th day. He was 20 years, 8 months, 2 weeks and 5 days old. His body was taken from there, and on Tuesday, May 5, and was then buried in Fjärås church"
