1 NAME Gustaf Albrekt /Lokrantz/
2 GIVN Gustaf Albrekt
2 SURN Lokrantz
2 _MARNM Lokrantz
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 7 APR 1833
2 ADDR
3 STAE (C)
3 CTRY Sweden
